  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU SUPPORT TO NESREA ON THE NATIONAL ENVIRONMENTAL PLASTIC WASTE CONTROL REGULATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is : to&amp;nbsp;provide Technical support to the National Environmental Standards and Regulations Enforcement Agency (NESREA) in enforcing/addressing&amp;nbsp;Plastic Waste&amp;nbsp;pollution challenge across all major sectors of Nigerian economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of this contract are is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Draft and gazette the National Environmental (Plastic Waste Control) Regulation 2023.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
